# UI & Design System Guidelines

- Primary Color Palette:
  - Main Primary: #89A482 (Sage Green)
  - Dark Accent: #5C6F57 (Deep Forest)
  - Light Accent: #B1C5AA
  - Soft Background: #EBF2E8
  - primary-soft: "#D9E5D6" (Card background / badge soft)
  - primary-light: "#B1C5AA" (Soft Light Sage untuk border & subtle highlight)
- Visual Rules (Anti-AI Slop):
  - Do NOT use generic AI neon gradients (purple/pink/cyan).
  - Do NOT use overly thick blurry drop-shadows. Use thin borders (`border-slate-200` or `border-[#B1C5AA]/40`).
  - Keep typography clean with clear font weight contrasts.
  - Keep UI layouts clean, human-crafted, and responsive.